\pard\b\fs20 Foggy Seas\b0\par
\fs16\par
On your expedition, your ship got into foggy waters where many ships have vanished before. And so your ship, too, ran aground on a ghostly sandbank that held it fast and dragged it into the depths of the sea. You managed to save yourself onto a small sand island, but to escape the foggy waters you have to build a blimp.\par
\par
The goal of the round is to build a blimp. But buildings need power and building material, and there is hardly any equipment.\par
